ons set + input shape) | status |\n|---|----------------|--------------------------------------------|--------|\n| 1 | `driver` | No options; by-value native `int` across its full domain, including zero, positive, negative, `INT_MIN`, and `INT_MAX`; fixed native `house_t` layout and byte order | [ ] |\n\nThere are no Cargo features and CMake defines no conditional build\nconfigurations, so this is the complete feature/configuration cross-product.\n[package]\nname = \"driver\"\nversion = \"0.1.0\"\nedition = \"2024\"\n\n[lib]\ncrate-type = [\"cdylib\"]\nname = \"driver\"\n\n[workspace]\n\n[dev-dependencies]\nlibloading = \"0.8\"\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
